# w.lang.en/shards/clauses: clause structure: joiners and how they cut, frame leads, self-correction markers, bare answers, question words and auxiliaries, negation, the lead words of an imperative
# sources: psys2 a019aa1e (PSys2 handover/lang.en and worlds/*/lexicon.sop: the English grammar of the demo, the project's own data)
